      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00641",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "难道我是在做梦吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Could I have been dreaming?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00641",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "啊，这句话我刚才已经说过了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ah, I already said that just now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00641",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "但是，那天晚上真的只是梦见的雏人偶吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But was it really only a doll I had dreamed of that night?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00641",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "难道是因为自己心心念念想看雏人偶，所以才会有这种幻觉吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Could it have been because I had longed so much to see the dolls that I had such a hallucination?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00641",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "即便到了今天，我也不知道那晚究竟是梦境，还是真实的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even today, I still do not know whether that night was a dream or reality.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
